DESCRIPTION:This is a required meeting for all band parents. \nPlease atten
 d one of the sessions below: \n2:00-3:00pm (meet in the band room 109) \n -
  or -\n6:30-7:30pm (meet in the band room 109).\n\nBoth sessions will meet 
 in the Band Room 109 (behind the theatre) \n\nThe agenda is as follows but 
 items may be added as the meeting gets closer:\n1) Calendar/date changes/ w
 hat to do if you have a schedule conflict \n2) Communication/sign-up for te
 xt message or email service /Band Google Calendar\n3) Walk-though of the cl
 ass website\n4) Expectations for the students/grading/conduct \n5) Specific
  fall needs for the students \n\n\nIf you are unable to attend\, the inform
 ation will be available via the Google Classroom after the meeting.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190825T171855Z
LOCATION:Hill-Murray School\, 2625 Larpenteur Ave E\, Maplewood\, MN 55109\
 , USA
