DESCRIPTION:This is one of our most important event of the fall as it's the
  ONLY time the two bands (concert band and symphonic band) practice togethe
 r before the performance. It is imperative that ALL members be there. Stude
 nts may NOT miss this rehearsal.\n\nPlease use the back band stairs to ente
 r/exit the building.\n\n6-8pm\nin marching band uniform\non the football fi
 eld.\nPlease bring a bottle of water\, attire\, flip folder\, music\, instr
 ument\, etc.\n\nBand Room Opens at 5:30pm\nReport 5:45pm\nBe on the field b
 y 6:00\nPractice starts promptly at 6:00\nPLEASE do not be late. \n\nPlease
  remember to wear black dress pants\, black shoes and black socks. Sweat pa
 nts\, running pants\, or jeans are not acceptable. They must be dress pants
 . You will also need your band jacket.\n\nWe will do a run through between 
 7:30 and 7:50-ISH and video that as well. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20210920T140018Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Marching Band Dress Rehearsal
