DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, May 19\, the Hill-Murray Bands and Orchestra will
  be going to Valleyfair to perform. The schedule for the day is below:\n\n1
 1:15 a.m. - Load bus at Hill-Murray \n11:30 a.m. - Depart Hill-Murray \n12:
 15 p.m. - Arrive at Valleyfair\n\nPerformances\n1:00-1:30 p.m. Orchestra\n1
 :30-2:00 p.m. Middle School Band\n2:00-2:30 p.m. Pioneer Pathways (PPW) Ban
 d\n2:30-3:00 p.m. Pioneer Pathways (PPW) Jazz Band\n3:00-3:30 p.m. Concert 
 Band\n3:30-4:00 p.m. Symphonic Band\n\n6:50 p.m. - Load bus at Valleyfair\n
 7:00 p.m. - Depart Valleyfair back to HM \n\nWe will stay for rides after w
 e perform! Students are able to purchase discounted ride passes. A permissi
 on slip has been sent home. If students would prefer to not stay for rides\
 , that is okay - they do not need to purchase a ride pass.
