 .  Students do not need to be in uniform as the weather usually requires wi
 nter coats at night.\n\n6:15 - move to the stands\n6:30 begin to play for t
 he crowd\n7pm - game start\n\nWe will stay for the entire game.\nPlease bri
 ng a cell phone to call for a ride in case we go into overtime or the weath
 er means we cancel. Bring $ for concessions.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: 
