  before the performance.  It is imperative that ALL members be there.  Stud
 ents may NOT miss this rehearsal.\n\nPlease use the back band stairs to ent
 er/exit the building.\n\n6:00- 8pm\nin marching band uniform\non the footba
 ll field.\nPlease bring a bottle of water\, attire\, flip folder\, music\, 
 instrument\, etc.\n\nBand Room Opens at 5:45\nReport 6pm\nBe on the field b
 y 6:15\nPractice starts promptly at 6:15\n\nPlease remember to wear black d
 ress pants\, black shoes and black socks. Sweat pants\, running pants\, or 
 jeans are not acceptable.  They must be dress pants.  You will also need yo
 ur band jacket. \n\nWe will do a run through at 7:15-7:30ish  Parents are e
 ncouraged to attend and watch.
