 member to wear black dress pants\, black shoes and black socks. Sweat pants
 \, running pants\, or jeans are not acceptable. They must be dress pants. Y
 ou will also need your band jacket.We will do a run through between 7:30 an
 d 7:50-ISH and video that as well. 
