DESCRIPTION:WE ARE RECORDING OUR SHOW! Please use the back band stairs to e
 nter/exit the building.\n\n6:30:-8:30pm\nin marching band uniform\non the f
 ootball field.\nPlease bring a bottle of water\, attire\, flip folder\, mus
 ic\, instrument\, etc.\n\nBand Room Opens at 6:00pm for "Grab and Go" a few
  students at a time.\nArrive between 6:00 - 6:15 at the back band door for 
 "grab and go" \nBe on the field socially distant by 6:30pm\nPractice starts
  promptly at 6:30pm\n\nPlease remember to wear black dress pants\, black sh
 oes and black socks. Sweat pants\, running pants\, or jeans are not accepta
 ble. They must be dress pants. You will also need your band jacket. We are 
 recording this as a performance at the end of practice! \n\nIf it rains - o
 ur back-up date is Thursday Oct 8.
