CREATED:20200917T140356Z
DESCRIPTION:Band at Girls Soccer vs. Mahtomedi<br><br>YES - It's a go!&nbsp
 \; We have a small but playable group based on instrumentation.<br><br>Resp
 onse REQUIRED<br><a href="https://forms.gle/Uc4mSt99mDctY2b47">https://form
 s.gle/Uc4mSt99mDctY2b47</a><br><br><br>CHANGE - LARGE INSTRUMENTS ( Or for 
 students who forgot to grab it) can access the building at 6:15pm with Mr. 
 Villesvik.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;Ms. Youngs will go to the track and set-up by the 
 garage and get the chairs set-up.&nbsp\;<br><br>Students from Concert Band 
 and Symphonic Band are invited to perform. If you have a conflict\, let Ms.
  Youngs know. If you are not comfortable with this\, you do not have to com
 e\, just please let me know ahead of time so we can plan if we have a playa
 ble group or not. We will decide about the playable group on Monday.  This 
 is not graded - it is strictly volunteer. <br><br>IMPORTANT CHANGES and COV
 ID PROCEDURES - READ CAREFULLY<br><br>We are away from the players and away
  from the stands and have our own entrance which is different and only we w
 ill use it. We will not be using the building or going inside. We will be f
 ar apart and exclusively outside with our musician PPE. Students will bring
  their own stuff and only touch their own items. <br><br>6:15 pm dropped of
 f to the EAST SIDE of HM at the GARAGE next to the field house. We will be 
 going in through the garage and WILL NOT be sharing an entrance with anyone
  else. We will have our own entrance. Wear layers and warm clothes! Student
 s do not need to be in uniform as the weather usually requires winter coats
  at night.<br><br>We will have our own area on the EAST side of the track f
 ar away from everyone with temporary fencing. Students will be touching ONL
 Y their own stuff and need to bring:<br><br>* We will provide folding chair
 s and we will bring the musician PPE outside to the band area and distribut
 e. <br><br>* Bring a backpack or bag with:<br><br>*Instrument\, lyre\, flip
  book with music\, and water bottle<br><br>We will NOT be using the bathroo
 ms in the stadium so please go before you get here. If there is an emergenc
 y I can bring you inside the building to use a bathroom. <br><br>We will be
  getting PIZZA (with water) for during the game.  If you have special dieta
 ry needs\, please let MS Youngs know right away and we will make arrangemen
 ts for you. <br><br>We will stay until the end of half time and then you ne
 ed to go home using ONLY the GARAGE and our separate area on the EAST side.
  <br><br>6:15 - Arrive<br>6:30 begin to play for the crowd<br>7pm - game st
 art<br><br>Please bring a cell phone to call in case the weather changes wh
 ile we're there. <br><br>Join Remind so if we cancel - you get a notice to 
 your phone.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200924T132726Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Band at Girls Soccer Sept 24
