CREATED:20201008T175121Z
DESCRIPTION:\nCANCEL\n\nBand at Football Oct 30\nLarge instrument pick up a
 t 6pm SHARP at the back band door. \n\nDrop off at East Garage at 6:15am\nP
 lay at 6:20pm\nGame starts at 7pm\nWe are done after half time and everyone
  will need to leave at that time. \n\nResponse REQUIRED and NEEDED (a Googl
 e form to sign-up will be available shortly)\n\n\nLARGE INSTRUMENTS ( Or fo
 r students who forgot to grab it) can access the building at 6pm  SHARP at 
 the back band door.  Please come right at 6pm  (Ms. Youngs has to be at the
  field by 6:15pm and can't be late). \n\nStudents from Concert Band and Sym
 phonic Band are invited to perform. If you have a conflict\, let Ms. Youngs
  know. If you are not comfortable with this\, you do not have to come\, jus
 t please let me know ahead of time so we can plan if we have a playable gro
 up or not. We will decide about the playable group on Monday. This is not g
 raded - it is strictly volunteer. \n\nIMPORTANT CHANGES and COVID PROCEDURE
 S - READ CAREFULLY\n\nWe are away from the players and away from the stands
  and have our own entrance.  We will not be using the building or going ins
 ide. We will be far apart and exclusively outside with our musician PPE.\n\
 n6:15 pm drop off to the EAST SIDE of HM at the GARAGE next to the field ho
 use. We will be going in through the garage and WILL NOT be sharing an entr
 ance with anyone else. We will have our own entrance. Wear layers and warm 
 clothes! Students do not need to be in uniform as the weather usually requi
 res winter coats for being outside for any length of time.\n\nWe will have 
 our own area on the EAST side of the track.\n\n* We will provide folding ch
 airs and Ms Youngs will bring the musician PPE outside to the band area and
  distribute. \n\n*Students:  Bring a backpack or bag with:\n*Instrument\, l
 yre\, flip book with music\, snacks and water bottle. No sharing please. \n
 \nWe will NOT be using the bathrooms in the stadium so please go before you
  get here. If there is an emergency I can bring you inside the building to 
 use a bathroom. \n\nWe will stay until the end of half time and then you ne
 ed to go home using ONLY our entrance/exit. \n\n6:15pm - Arrive\n6:30pm beg
 in to play for the crowd\n7pm - game start\n\nPlease bring a cell phone to 
 call in case the weather changes. \n\nPlease Join Remind so if we cancel - 
 you get a notice to your phone.
LAST-MODIFIED:20201029T140914Z
LOCATION:Hill-Murray School\, 2625 Larpenteur Ave E\, Maplewood\, MN 55109\
 , USA
