DESCRIPTION:Students who audition will be expected to perform scales\, rhyt
 hms\, and the enclosed musical selections. Auditions will be held (for curr
 ent HM students) on Tuesday\, May 14 during WIN times from 10:30 – 12:00 p.
 m. and on Wednesday\, May 15 during WIN times from 10:30 a.m. – 12:00 p.m. 
 You will need to schedule a time to come during WIN time. Auditions will be
  held after school on May 14 from 2:45 ­ 4pm which will be open auditions. 
 You will not need to make an appointment for afterschool on May 14 ­ Studen
 ts will be auditioned in the order of arrival. If neither of these dates wo
 rks for your family\, please contact me before Thursday\, May 2\, to set up
  an audition time. My contact information appears at the end of this letter
 . All auditions must be completed on or before Thursday\, May 16. We have d
 eadlines on our end to get information to registrars for any schedules chan
 ges that may need to happen for students\, so we must be firm on the May 16
 th deadline for auditions. 
