CREATED:20160428T190731Z
DESCRIPTION:This is one of our most important event of the fall as its the 
 ONLY time the two bands (concert band and symphonic band) practice together
  before the performance.  It is imperative that ALL members be there.  Stud
 ents may NOT miss this rehearsal.\n\nPlease use the back band stairs to ent
 er/exit the building.\n\n5:00- 7:00pm\nin marching band uniform\non the foo
 tball field.\nPlease bring a bottle of water\, attire\, flip folder\, music
 \, instrument\, etc.\n\nBand Room Opens at 4:45\nReport 5pm\nBe on the fiel
 d by 5:15\nPractice starts promptly at 5:15\n\nPlease remember to wear blac
 k dress pants\, black shoes and black socks. Sweat pants\, running pants\, 
 or jeans are not acceptable.  They must be dress pants.  You will also need
  your band jacket. \n\nWe will do a run through at 6:30-6:45ish  Parents ar
 e encouraged to attend and watch.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160913T142256Z
LOCATION:Hill-Murray School\, 2625 Larpenteur Ave E\, Maplewood\, MN 55109\
 , United States
