CREATED:20160913T180237Z
DESCRIPTION:Boys Soccer Playoffs (At Neutral Site - Mahtomedi HS)\n\nPlease
  use the back band stairs to enter/exit the building.\n\n3:45pm report to t
 he band room wearing as many layers and warm clothes as possible.  Students
  do not need to be in uniform as the weather usually requires winter coats.
 \n\n4:00pm - Bus leaves for Mahtomedi\n4:20pm - Arrive at Mahtomedi move to
  the stands\n4:30pm begin to play for the crowd\n5pm - game start\n\nWe owe
  the boys' soccer team a game.  Wed morning is All School Testing.  Therefo
 re\, we are playing the first game only.  We will not be doing a double hea
 der because of the important testing in the morning. \n\nWe will leave prom
 ptly after the game and as soon as everyone is on the bus.\n\nIf you are NO
 T riding the bus you will need a signed (parent signature) transportation f
 orm. \n\nPlease bring a cell phone to call for a ride just in case.\n\nJoin
  with Google Hangouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/aG1waW9u
 ZWVyYmFuZEBnbWFpbC5jb20.st9gu8efl3e4fk4gce2dfokr04?hs=121
