 se use the back band stairs to enter/exit the building.\n\n6pm report to th
 e band room wearing as many layers and warm clothes as possible. Students d
 o not need to be in uniform as the weather usually requires winter coats at
  night.\n\n6:15 - move to the stands\n6:30 begin to play for the crowd\n7pm
  - game start\n\nWe will stay until the END OF HALFTIME.\nPlease bring a ce
 ll phone to call for a ride or the weather means we cancel. Bring $ for con
 cessions if you wish.
