DESCRIPTION:Girls Soccer @ US Bank\nPlease use the back band stairs to ente
 r/exit the building.\n\n2:10pm report to the band room. You can wear costum
 es that are neat\, clean and modest.  NO MASKS and NO CLOWNS.  \n\n2:10pm- 
 Report the band room\n2:30pm - Bus leaves for US BANK\n3:00pm -Arrive at US
  Bank \n3:30pm-Begin to play for the crowd\n4:00pm - Game start\n\nWe will 
 be staying for the whole game.\nWe will leave promptly after the game and a
 s soon as everyone is on the bus.\n\nIf you are NOT riding the bus you will
  need a signed (parent signature) transportation form. You can find one pos
 ted on FinalSite in the Resources section in the Pep and Marching Band Fold
 er.  You can also get a paper copy from Traci in the band office.  \n\nPlea
 se bring a cell phone just in case the game runs long. \n\nBring money for 
 concessions.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts
 /_/calendar/aG1waW9uZWVyYmFuZEBnbWFpbC5jb20.rfbpvgk89j0ufsf8ikfp4u1bpg?hs=1
 21
