 d both days (lunch on Jan 23\, dinner on Jan 30) Accommodations can be made
  for food allergies/ vegan/etc. as long as they know in advance. \n\nMusic 
 will be distributed ahead of time and you are expected to know the music be
 fore you arrive for the first practice. \n\nYou will have forms to fill out
  for participation. I'll get those to you as the date gets closer. \n\nConc
 ert Band Conductor is Catherine Sinon Bushman - St. Cloud\nJazz Band Conduc
 tor is Bob Baca - Eau Claire\n\nWe will meet at the rehearsal and performan
 ce site all days.  
