DESCRIPTION:This is one of our most important event of the fall as its the 
 ONLY time the two bands (concert band and symphonic band) practice together
  before the performance. It is imperative that ALL members be there. Studen
 ts may NOT miss this rehearsal.\n\nPlease use the back band stairs to enter
 /exit the building.\n\n6-8pm\nin marching band uniform\non the football fie
 ld.\nPlease bring a bottle of water\, attire\, flip folder\, music\, instru
 ment\, etc.\n\nBand Room Opens at 5:30pm\nReport 5:45pm\nBe on the field by
  6:00\nPractice starts promptly at 6:00\n\nPlease remember to wear black dr
 ess pants\, black shoes and black socks. Sweat pants\, running pants\, or j
 eans are not acceptable. They must be dress pants. You will also need your 
 band jacket. \n\nWe will do a run through between 7:30 and 7:50-ISH Parents
  are encouraged to attend and watch.
