CREATED:20140425T171615Z
DESCRIPTION:Solo/Ensemble Contest for High School - \nParticipation is volu
 ntary for high school students EXCEPT HONORS SYM STUDENTS.  Honors Symphoni
 c students are required to participate. \nStudents who participate are assi
 gned a 10 minute performance time during the day between 8am and 5pm.   In 
 all\, with warm-up time\, students would be there about 30 -40 minutes tota
 l.  Schedule requests are possible but since the contest manager is coordin
 ating many schools we should try to keep special requests to a minimum. Mor
 e information will be available as the date gets closer. \nPreparing the st
 udents starts in the fall with picking music and ordering music. We hire a 
 professional piano accompanist that most students use.  You are welcome to 
 hire your own piano player as well.  The band syllabus has more details.  F
 eel free to call and ask with questions.  I'm happy to help. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20140514T130801Z
LOCATION:Tartan High School\, Greenway Avenue North\, Oakdale\, MN\, United
  States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
