DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>Double Header Boys and Girls Soccer 5pm and 7pm<br><
 br><b>Pizza Dinner and drink selection will be provided.&nbsp\; We can acco
 mmodate any students that have dietary restrictions as long as we know by S
 ept 19.</b><br><br>Please use the back band stairs to enter/exit the buildi
 ng.<br><br>4:15pm report to the band room wearing as many layers and warm c
 lothes as possible. Students do not need to be in uniform as the weather us
 ually requires winter coats at night.<br><br>4:30pm - move to the stands<br
 >4:35pm- begin to play for the crowd<br>5pm game start<br><b>Pizza and pop/
 water will be provided for dinner.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;We can accommodate any stud
 ents that have dietary restrictions as long as we know by Sept 19.</b><br><
 br>6:30pm play for the crowd again<br>7pm&nbsp\; second game starts<br><br>
 We will stay until the end of halftime and then students will be released a
 s its a school night.&nbsp\;<br>Please bring a cell phone to call for a rid
 e in case we go into overtime or the weather means we cancel. Bring $ for c
 oncessions if you wish.</html-blob>
