DESCRIPTION:Performance times @ 4\, 6\, and 8pm. \nOrder undetermined at th
 is time.\n\nStudents should arrive to school in concert attire and bring th
 eir instruments\, music\, portable stand and deliver to the band room. We w
 ill load the bus and leave immediately after school. \n\nStudents will have
  time to go on rides and/or go shopping. Exact logistics will be available 
 as the date gets closer. An opportunity to order discount ride passes will 
 be presented in the packet of information. Information packets will be hand
 ed out in early November. \n\nPerformance Times:\n4pm - H-M Middle School B
 and/H-M Orchestra\n6pm - Pioneer Pathways Bands/Orchestra\n8pm - H-M Concer
 t Band/ H-MSymphonic Band\n\nThe bus will get back to Hill-Murray at approx
 imately 9:30pm. \n\nIf you are unable to attend\, please have a parent/guar
 dian email the teacher so we can be prepared to cover instrumentation.\n\nI
 f you are planning on driving separate you will need to complete a TRANSPOR
 TATION FORM available on Google Classroom.  Students will need to turn this
  in a day or two BEFORE the event with the proper signatures. \n\nStudents 
 will need money for dinner\, snacks\, and shopping.
LAST-MODIFIED:20191208T163427Z
LOCATION:Mall of America®\, 60 E Broadway\, Bloomington\, MN 55425\, USA
