DESCRIPTION:<br>You are all invited to attend our Band Parent Organization 
 Meeting via Zoom tomorrow at 6:30pm.&nbsp\; If you're busy\, that is not a 
 problem. You are welcome to attend as many or as few as fits your schedule.
 &nbsp\; The BPO will be setting their meeting dates for the year and they w
 ill be posted on the Band's Google Calendar.&nbsp\; You can find the Google
  Calendar info on Google Classroom.&nbsp\;<br><br>See below for an email fr
 om Todd Thoms\, the BPO President<br>______________________________________
 ______________________________________________________________<br><p>Hello 
 everyone\,</p><p>&nbsp\;</p><p>Welcome to a new\, and challenging\, new sch
 ool year.&nbsp\; Sure hope this note finds you healthy and doing well.</p><
 p>&nbsp\;</p><p>As we get into the groove for a new school year\, we want t
 o hold our first BPO meeting for this school year.&nbsp\; With all the flux
 ing schedules and changing conditions\, we will hold our meeting on Thursda
 y @ 6:30 PM.&nbsp\; Traci will create a Zoom online session and we will mee
 t through this method (probably a few more like this in our future as well.
 )&nbsp\; We will send out the Zoom session information before 6:30 PM tomor
 row evening\, so be on the lookout for it.</p><p>&nbsp\;</p><p>I am using a
 n email list from last May\, so please a) let me know if you want/need to b
 e removed from our meeting email distribution list and b) if there are emai
 l addresses that should be added to our distribution list.&nbsp\; (we can a
 lways keep alumni parents on the list if they want to stay engaged&nbsp\;😊
 &nbsp\; )</p><p>&nbsp\;</p><p>Agenda will be structured very similar to our
  meetings last year\; here is a high level outline sample.</p><p>&nbsp\;</p
 ><p>Major topics for this evening are:</p><p>&nbsp\;</p><ol><li>Meeting sta
 rt</li><li>Introductions (if new members join)</li><li>Review meeting notes
  from last session (if available)</li><li>Treasury report (if any available
  updates are ready for review)</li><li>Business<ol><li>Used Uniform Sale\, 
 how did it go in August\; lessons learned?</li><li>Start of year planning\;
  what is needed by the band in September/October that BPO can assist with?<
 /li></ol></li></ol><p>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbs
