DESCRIPTION:Since the weather is suppose to be nice next week\, the band wo
 uld like to play for everyone as they depart on Tuesday after school.  They
  would like to play on the front lawn with full PPE and will be socially di
 stanced.  They would play pep band (pop and rock tunes) and of course the s
 chool song.  They would need to be excused from WIN for the last 10 minutes
  to grab their instruments and head outside.  They would be done playing at
  2:50pm\, would put their instruments away and head home. \n\nVolunteer Eve
