BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20200915
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20200916
DTSTAMP:20261005T191706Z
UID:47rogpd914engh8vo867428ps4@google.com
CREATED:20200827T193010Z
DESCRIPTION:\nCANCEL!!!\nWe don't have a playable group due to lack of resp
 onses (65% of families did not respond).  We will try again for a different
  game. \nCANCEL!!!\n___________________________________________________\nBa
 nd at Soccer vs. ?\n\nThis is tentative pending a playable group.\n\nStuden
 ts from Concert Band and Symphonic Band are invited to perform. If you have
  a conflict\, let Ms. Youngs know.  If you are not comfortable with this\, 
 you do not have to come\, just please let me know ahead of time so we can p
 lan if we have a playable group or not. We will decide about the playable g
 roup the week before. This is not graded - it is strictly volunteer. \n\nIM
 PORTANT CHANGES  and COVID PROCEDURES - READ CAREFULLY\n\nWe are away from 
 the players and away from the stands and have our own entrance which is dif
 ferent and only we will use it. We will not be using the building or going 
 inside.  We will be far apart and exclusively outside with our musician PPE
 .  Students will bring their own stuff and only touch their own items. \n\n
 6:15 pm dropped off to the EAST SIDE  of HM at the GARAGE next to the field
  house. We will be going in through the garage and WILL NOT be sharing an e
 ntrance with anyone else. We will have our own entrance. Wear layers and wa
 rm clothes! Students do not need to be in uniform as the weather usually re
 quires winter coats at night.\n\nWe will have our own area on the EAST side
  of the track far away from everyone with temporary fencing.  Students will
  be touching ONLY their own stuff and need to bring:\n\n* Their own lawn ch
 air/ folding chair which will be set up far apart .  We will space you out 
 BEFORE you put your chair down and set-up.  We will be very far apart.\n\n\
 n* Bring a backpack or bag with:\n\n*Instrument\, lyre\, flip book with mus
 ic\n*Musician PPE - musician mask\, regular mask\, flute shields\, bell cov
 ers\, and woodwind bags. \n*Water Bottle\n\nWe will NOT be using the bathro
 oms in the stadium so please go before you get here.  If there is an emerge
 ncy I can bring you inside the building to use a bathroom. \n\nWe will NOT 
 be getting concessions or eating so please eat before you come. Masks need 
 to stay on for the duration you are here. \n\n\nWe will stay until the end 
 of half time and then you need to go home using ONLY the GARAGE and our sep
 arate area on the EAST side. \n\n\n6:15 - Arrive with your folding chair\, 
 PPE\, and music stuff.\n6:30 begin to play for the crowd\n7pm - game start\
 n\nPlease bring a cell phone to call in case the weather changes while we'r
 e there. \n\nJoin Remind so if we cancel - you get a notice to your phone.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200914T140021Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CANCEL! - Band at Soccer
