DESCRIPTION:We will be taking the Marching Band Indoor Concert on the road 
 to three Parish Schools.  Students will miss a day of school and will be re
 sponsible for all missing work.  In addition\, students lunches will be pro
 vided thanks to the admissions office. \n\nThis is a REALLY important event
  for the band and as ambassadors for Hill-Murray School.  We need everyone 
 there and playing!\n\nSchedule: \nLoad 9:50 and depart at 10am\nPresentatio
 n - 10:30\nSt. Pascals - 12:30\nQuick lunch.  Assorted Pizza \, Pop\, and w
 ater by Little Oven!!! \nSt. Peter - 2:30\nReturn to HM - 4pm\n\nWear your 
 marching band uniforms: \nBlack dress pants\, black socks\, black shoes\, b
 and polo\, band jacket.\n\nBring: \nInstrument\, music\, flip folder\, lyre
 \, anything else you may need. Please do not leave valuables unattended or 
 on the bus.  It will be best to leave valuables like Ipods\, etc at home fo
 r the day.\n\nParents/ Families are welcome to attend any or all of our con
 certs at the Parish schools. Please check-in at the school's main office fo
 r a guest badge. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221207T002219Z
