 phonic Band are expected to perform. If you have a conflict\, let Ms. Young
 s know. \n\nPlease use the back band stairs to enter/exit the building.\n\n
 6pm report to the band room wearing as many layers and warm clothes as poss
 ible. Students do not need to be in uniform as the weather usually requires
  winter coats at night.\n\n6:15 - move to the stands\n6:30 begin to play fo
 r the crowd\n7pm - game start\n\nWe will stay for the entire game.\nPlease 
 bring a cell phone to call for a ride in case we go into overtime or the we
 ather means we cancel. Bring $ for concessions if you wish.
