DESCRIPTION:Jazz Contest at North St Paul High School\n2416 East 11th Avenu
 e\nNorth St. Paul MN 55109\n\nHill-Murray's Jazz Band students will perform
  for three jazz adjudicators\, receiving feedback and an overall rating on 
 our performance. We will also be able to watch the performances of other sc
 hools\, which is a great learning opportunity. \n\nWe will be leaving Hill-
 Murray and traveling via bus to North at 8:15am.\n\nWe will leave North and
  head back to Hill-Murray at 11:30am. All students will eat D lunch.\n\nStu
 dents will be excused from 2nd and 4th hour on that day and are responsible
  for any missing work. \n\nHill-Murray is scheduled to perform at 9:00am. P
 arents are welcome to attend\, but per North St. Paul policy\, all must be 
 wearing masks at all times. 
