 yYmFuZEBnbWFpbC5jb20.42bj0nfgfssnqiudda54u0du2f
CREATED:20170829T123424Z
DESCRIPTION:Jeannie Judge from Catholic Schools Center of Excellence (CSCOE
 ) contacted H-M concerning an invitation for the Hill-Murray School Band to
  perform at the inaugural Called to Excellence: Catholic Schools Summit on 
 October 18\, 2017 at the Minneapolis Convention Center. They are expecting 
 1800-2200 staff\, faculty\, principals\, and pastors of Pre-K to 8 schools 
 in the Archdiocese of St. Paul-Minneapolis to attend that day which promise
 s to acknowledge\, support\, recognize\, and celebrate all who make our Pre
 -K to 8 Catholic schools excellent!\n \nCSCOE was searching for a Catholic 
 high school band to be part of their dynamic and celebratory send-off at th
 e end of the summit.  The Hill-Murray band will play during the Summit’s cl
 osing session and then usher participants to the doors as they head into th
 e MEA weekend.  The approximate performance time-frame is 3:15-3:45 pm for 
 the performance. In consideration of our commitment to CSCOE\, they will co
 ver transportation expenses to/from H-M and the Minneapolis Convention Cent
 er and will make a donation to the Hill-Murray band program. We will have m
 ore concrete details (pick-up time\, etc) as the date gets closer and of co
 urse if we accept the invitation. \n\nEstimated Schedule:\nReport time is 2
 :00pm wearing black shoes\, black socks\, black dress pants\, a Hill-Murray
  polo shirt\, and your band jacket. Bring your flip book (music)\, instrume
 nt\, and all needed accessories.   Bring extra warm clothes\, hats\, mitten
 s\, etc if you are staying through to pep band. \n\nReport 2pm\nDepart at 2
 :10pm\nArrive at Convention Center at 2:45pm\nOn Deck for Performance at 3:
 00\nPerform 3:15 - 3:45pm\nLoad bus and depart at 4pm\nReturn to H-M at 4:3
 0pm\n\nStay for a Movie and Pizza Party from 4:30-6pm\nPep Band at 6:00pm\n
 \n\n\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calen
 dar/aG1waW9uZWVyYmFuZEBnbWFpbC5jb20.42bj0nfgfssnqiudda54u0du2f?hs=121
LAST-MODIFIED:20171018T141322Z
LOCATION:Minneapolis Convention Center 301 2nd Ave. S.\, Minneapolis MN\, 1
 301 2nd Ave S\, Minneapolis\, MN 55403\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Band at CSCOE Convention!
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-GOOGLE-HANGOUT:https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/aG1waW9uZWVyYm
 FuZEBnbWFpbC5jb20.42bj0nfgfssnqiudda54u0du2f
