CREATED:20200928T154450Z
DESCRIPTION:Band at Football Oct 10<br>Large instrument pick up at 11am SHA
 RP at the back band door.&nbsp\;<br><br>Drop off at East Garage at 11:15am<
 br>Play at 11:30am<br>Game starts at 12 noon<br>We are done after half time
  and everyone will need to leave at that time.&nbsp\;<br><br>Response REQUI
 RED and NEEDED<br><a href="https://forms.gle/Uc4mSt99mDctY2b47">https://for
 ms.gle/Uc4mSt99mDctY2b47</a><br><br><br>LARGE INSTRUMENTS ( Or for students
  who forgot to grab it) can access the building at 11:00&nbsp\; SHARP at th
 e back band door.&nbsp\; Please come right at 11am&nbsp\; (Ms. Youngs has t
 o be at the field by 11:15am and can't be late).&nbsp\;<br><br>Students fro
 m Concert Band and Symphonic Band are invited to perform. If you have a con
 flict\, let Ms. Youngs know. If you are not comfortable with this\, you do 
 not have to come\, just please let me know ahead of time so we can plan if 
 we have a playable group or not. We will decide about the playable group on
  Monday. This is not graded - it is strictly volunteer.&nbsp\;<br><br>IMPOR
 TANT CHANGES and COVID PROCEDURES - READ CAREFULLY<br><br>We are away from 
 the players and away from the stands and have our own entrance.&nbsp\; We w
 ill not be using the building or going inside. We will be far apart and exc
 lusively outside with our musician PPE.<br><br>11:15 am dropped off to the 
 EAST SIDE of HM at the GARAGE next to the field house. We will be going in 
 through the garage and WILL NOT be sharing an entrance with anyone else. We
  will have our own entrance. Wear layers and warm clothes! Students do not 
 need to be in uniform as the weather usually requires winter coats for bein
 g outside for any length of time.<br><br>We will have our own area on the E
 AST side of the track.<br><br>* We will provide folding chairs and Ms Young
 s will bring the musician PPE outside to the band area and distribute.&nbsp
 \;<br><br>*Students:&nbsp\; Bring a backpack or bag with:<br>*Instrument\, 
 lyre\, flip book with music\, snacks and water bottle. No sharing please.&n
 bsp\;<br><br>We will NOT be using the bathrooms in the stadium so please go
  before you get here. If there is an emergency I can bring you inside the b
 uilding to use a bathroom.&nbsp\;<br><br>We will stay until the end of half
  time and then you need to go home using ONLY our entrance/exit.&nbsp\;<br>
 <br>11:15am - Arrive<br>11:30 begin to play for the crowd<br>12 Noon - game
  start<br><br>Please bring a cell phone to call in case the weather changes
 .&nbsp\;<br><br>Please Join Remind so if we cancel - you get a notice to yo
 ur phone.
LAST-MODIFIED:20201012T120138Z
LOCATION:Hill-Murray School\, 2625 Larpenteur Ave E\, Maplewood\, MN 55109\
 , USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
