DESCRIPTION:<br>**THIS EVENT HAS BEEN CANCELLED DUE TO FORECASTED WEATHER C
 ONDITIONS**<br>Band at Football Oct 23<br>Large instrument pick up at 6pm S
 HARP at the back band door.&nbsp\;<br><br>Drop off at East Garage at 6:15pm
 <br>Play at 6:20pm<br>Game starts at 7pm<br>We are done after half time and
  everyone will need to leave at that time.&nbsp\;<br><br>Response REQUIRED 
 and NEEDED<br><a href="https://forms.gle/Uc4mSt99mDctY2b47">https://docs.go
 ogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSciBbTp2sjqejiS4WFt2oNDIV7AmaHEYB0Wu7K05agd3COE6w
 /viewform?usp=sf_link</a><br><br><br>LARGE INSTRUMENTS ( Or for students wh
 o forgot to grab it) can access the building at 6pm&nbsp\; SHARP at the bac
 k band door.&nbsp\; Please come right at 6pm&nbsp\; (Ms. Youngs has to be a
 t the field by 6:15pm and can't be late).&nbsp\;<br><br>Students from Conce
 rt Band and Symphonic Band are invited to perform. If you have a conflict\,
  let Ms. Youngs know. If you are not comfortable with this\, you do not hav
 e to come\, just please let me know ahead of time so we can plan if we have
  a playable group or not. We will decide about the playable group on Monday
 . This is not graded - it is strictly volunteer.&nbsp\;<br><br>IMPORTANT CH
 ANGES and COVID PROCEDURES - READ CAREFULLY<br><br>We are away from the pla
 yers and away from the stands and have our own entrance.&nbsp\; We will not
  be using the building or going inside. We will be far apart and exclusivel
 y outside with our musician PPE.<br><br>6:15 pm drop off to the EAST SIDE o
 f HM at the GARAGE next to the field house. We will be going in through the
  garage and WILL NOT be sharing an entrance with anyone else. We will have 
 our own entrance. Wear layers and warm clothes! Students do not need to be 
 in uniform as the weather usually requires winter coats for being outside f
 or any length of time.<br><br>We will have our own area on the EAST side of
  the track.<br><br>* We will provide folding chairs and Ms Youngs will brin
 g the musician PPE outside to the band area and distribute.&nbsp\;<br><br>*
 Students:&nbsp\; Bring a backpack or bag with:<br>*Instrument\, lyre\, flip
  book with music\, snacks and water bottle. No sharing please.&nbsp\;<br><b
 r>We will NOT be using the bathrooms in the stadium so please go before you
  get here. If there is an emergency I can bring you inside the building to 
 use a bathroom.&nbsp\;<br><br>We will stay until the end of half time and t
 hen you need to go home using ONLY our entrance/exit.&nbsp\;<br><br>6:15pm 
 - Arrive<br>6:30pm begin to play for the crowd<br>7pm - game start<br><br>P
 lease bring a cell phone to call in case the weather changes.&nbsp\;<br><br
 >Please Join Remind so if we cancel - you get a notice to your phone.<br><b
 r>**THIS EVENT HAS BEEN CANCELLED DUE TO FORECASTED WEATHER CONDITIONS**
