 d Spaghetti Factory in Minneapolis\n11:20am (approximately) – Arrive at Old
  Spaghetti Factory\n11:20am-12:30pm – Lunch\nLunch will be served at approx
 imately 11:30am\nLunch price includes: Spaghetti and meatballs\, salad\, br
 ead\, dessert\, coffee\, tea\, milk\, tax\, and gratuity\n12:30pm – Load bu
 s and depart Old Spaghetti Factory\n1:00-1:19pm (approximately) – Arrive at
