CREATED:20100526T153434Z
DESCRIPTION:Grade School Tour - Symphonic Band\n\nDuring third hour you wil
 l move percussion equipment and large instruments down to the Commons entra
 nce to be loaded onto the trailer. After MP get your coat and quickly go to
  the band room\, grab your music and instrument and stand\, and get on the 
 bus immediately. We MUST leave at 10:45! That gives us 9 minutes to get coa
 ts\, equipment\, and load the bus.\n\nBus arrives 10am\nDepart 10:45am\nArr
 ive at St. Jerome 11:05am (384 Roselawn Avenue East\, Maplewood\, MN  55117
 )\nPerform 11:15am-12:15pm\nDepart St. Jerome 12:30pm\nStop for fast food o
 n the way and eat on bus or bring bag lunch\nArrive at St. Michael’s 1:30pm
  (337 E. Hurley St.\, West St. Paul\, MN 55118)\nPerform 2-3pm\nDepart St. 
 Michael’s 3:15pm \nArrive H-M 3:45pm\n\nPLEASE BRING A PORTABLE MUSIC STAND
 !!!\n\nYou are responsible for all work that is missed.\n\nIf you need a ri
 de when we return\, please make sure they are here at 3:45 or that you go t
 o a supervised area to wait for your normal ride.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221207T002551Z
LOCATION:Twin Cities Schools
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Grade School Tour - Symphonic Band
