CREATED:20131104T144850Z
DESCRIPTION:Middle School Band at Mall of America\nDress for the Concert is
  NICE DRESS CLOTHES - Christmas/Holiday colors are OK. This is a high profi
 le performance - Look nice! (Ladies - Stage is elevated). \nIt will streaml
 ine things if you don't need to change. However\, if you need to change\, t
 here is an opportunity from 5:00-5:15pm. Students - you MUST stay with the 
 group you signed-up for!  No one may go by themselves - remember safety in 
 numbers!!! \n2:18pm Load the bus/trailer\n2:30pm Leave \n3:00 pm Drop off a
 t MOA - East side Entrance. All cases\, backpacks\, etc will be left in the
  locked trailer.  Ride passes will be passed out at MOA.  Ms. Youngs will b
 e the chaperone at the rides.  She will be walking in Nic Universe  and wil
 l stop in front of the American Girl Store every hour and half-hour (0:30\,
 1:00)  Mr. Zosel will meet the students at the drop-off site every quarter 
 after the hour and quarter to the hour. (0:15 and 0:45)\n5:00pm meet at the
  Drop off site - Behind Rotunda\, East side Entrance by Barnes and Noble/Se
 aLife Aquarium. The bus will meet us to pick up items.  Percussion will go 
 on bus to the loading dock under the mall with Ms. Youngs. All other studen
 ts will go to the Minnetonka Room with Mr. Z to get ready and warm-up.\n6pm
  Perform in the Rotunda \nAfter Performance\,  Percussion - Meet Ms. Youngs
  - We will go back through the tunnels and load the bus/trailer - Then we w
 ill go pick up the rest of the band and drop off anyone staying with their 
 parents. All others will go back to the Lake Minnetonka Room with Mr. Z.\nP
 arents - please meet us at the Behind Rotunda\, East side Entrance by Barne
 s and Noble/SeaLife Aquarium to pick up students who are staying behind wit
 h you. \nThe bus will return to HM as soon as we get loaded. \nPlease progr
 am Ms. Youngs' cell phone number into your phone if you haven't done alread
 y. \nSmart Phones - bookmark this site - it's a map of the mall\n http://ww
 w.mallofamerica.com/shopping/map
LAST-MODIFIED:20221207T002549Z
LOCATION:Mall of America
