DESCRIPTION:Symphonic Band students will need to be in concert black for th
 e day.  Changing facilities or time to change will not be available.  Pleas
 e come to school in concert black. \n\nContest Day-March 6\, 2012\nCome to 
 school wearing concert black. \nBus arrives at 9:00\nLeave at 9:20 for Tart
 an\nSet-up on stage 10am\nPerform 10:15am \nListen to St. Anthony and Woodb
 ury while we wait for our scores. \nReturn to HM 12:00pm\nLunch in cafeteri
 a 12:00-12:30pm.\nTeam bonding and celebration to be scheduled later.\nStud
 ents will miss classes 4 and 5 and will eat “C” Lunch at HM. Students will 
 be responsible to make-up missed work. \n\n\nStudents need to bring their o
 wn music\, instrument\, reeds\, tuners\, valve oil\, etc.  Lunch is at HM f
 or period 5C. Students are representatives of Hill-Murray School and approp
 riate behavior is expected. \n\nParents are welcomed and encouraged to atte
 nd the contest performance at Tartan HS.  We would love to see you there to
  support the HM Band.  If you are unable to attend\, we will be performing 
 the music at the March 13 concert. Please see the Google Calendar for detai
 ls.  \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221207T002833Z
LOCATION:Tartan High School
