DESCRIPTION:Girls Soccer vs Waconia @ St. Cloud State University\n\nPlease 
 use the back band stairs to enter/exit the building.\n\n4:30pm report to th
 e band room (Bring your own bag dinner) wearing as many layers and warm clo
 thes as possible.  Students do not need to be in uniform as the weather usu
 ally requires winter coats\, gloves\,hats\, etc.\n\nBring Your Own Bag Dinn
 er!\n4:30pm Report\n4:45pm - Bus leaves for St. Cloud\n6:45pm - Arrive in S
 t. Cloud -move to the stands\n7:00pm begin to play for the crowd\n7:30pm - 
 game start\nBring Your Own Bag Dinner!\n\nWe will be staying for the whole 
 game.\nWe will leave promptly after the game and as soon as everyone is on 
 the bus.\n\nIf you are NOT riding the bus you will need a signed (parent si
 gnature) transportation form. You can find one posted on FinalSite in the R
 esources section in the Pep and Marching Band Folder.  You can also get a p
 aper copy from Traci in the band office.  \n\nPlease bring a cell phone jus
 t in case the game runs long. \n\nBring money for concessions. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221207T002652Z
LOCATION:St. Cloud State University
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Girls Soccer State #1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
