DESCRIPTION:Woodbury Chamber of Commerce Event Performance\nTime 2pm - 2:30
 pm\nLocation - Woodbury High School\n\n\n2665 Woodlane Drive Woodbury MN 55
 125\n\nPlan to arrive at 1:30 for tuning. \n\nParking:\n Park in the front
  parking lots and access through the “Activities Entrance.”\nIf parking is 
 limited on the front side of the school\, you can park in the South parking
  lot near\nthe South entrance (entrance for WHS theatre).\n\nLocation: Vars
 ity Gym (smaller gym)\nEnter through the Activities entrance and take a lef
 t to follow the hallway to the Varsity gym.\nThere will be a  stage for the
  performance with chairs set up in front of the stage for\nguests.\nThere i
 s no storage area by the stage so ​bring your cases with you on stage.  We 
 can put them behind us. \n Plan to bring a portable stand.  I haven't heard
  back if they have them there.
