DESCRIPTION:Calendar Request submitted June 4\, 2025<br><br>Football Pep Ba
 nd - This is a graded performance. <br><br>Students 9-12 are expected to pe
 rform. If you have a conflict\, let Ms. Youngs know ASAP.  We will work it 
 out. Two weeks in advance would be good so we can figure out our performanc
 e list. <br><br>Please use the back band stairs to enter/exit the building 
 using door #6 ONLY.  5:00 pm report to the band room to pick up your instru
 ments. Please wear your band jacket and black on the bottom. Bring a winter
  coat/hats/gloves etc. It gets cold when the sun goes down. <br>5:00 - 5:15
  report<br>5:15 - move to our seating area <br>5:30pm begin to play for the
  crowd <br>Game starts at 6pm<br><br>We will stay until the end of halftime
  and then students will be released after they put their instruments away.<
 br><br><b>1) They can get picked up and may leave through DOOR #6 (please d
 o not pick them up at any other door as this is a security issue)</b><br><b
 >2) They can go back to the game and become part of the student section. </
 b><br>Please bring a cell phone to call for a ride in case the weather mean
 s we cancel. <br>Bring $ for concessions if you wish.
