 airs to enter/exit the building using door #6 ONLY.  5:00 - 5:15 pm report 
 to the band room to pick up your instruments. Please wear warm clothes (col
 ors are fine)  Bring a winter coat/hats/gloves etc. It gets cold when the s
 un goes down. <br>Report 5pm - 5:15pm<br>5:25 - move to our seating area <b
 r>5:30pm pm begin to play for the crowd <br>Game starts at 6pm<br><br>We wi
 ll stay until the end of halftime and then students will be released after 
 they put their instruments away.<br><br><b>1) They can get picked up and ma
 y leave through DOOR #6 (please do not pick them up at any other door as th
 is is a security issue)</b><br><b>2) They can go back to the game and becom
 e part of the student section. </b><br>Please bring a cell phone to call fo
 r a ride in case the weather means we cancel. <br>Bring $ for concessions i
 f you wish.
