DESCRIPTION:Calendar request submitted on June 4\, 2025<br><br>This is a gr
 aded performance.  Please let me if you can't be there and we will work it 
 out. Two weeks in advance will be needed so we can plan ahead on what we ar
 e going to perform. <br><br>Please use the back band stairs to enter/exit t
 he building using door #6 ONLY. <br>Dinner will be provided - this will be 
 decided closer to the performance date <br><br>PIZZA PARTY TONIGHT! <br>Rep
 ort  band room wearing your band jacket and black on the bottom. Students s
 hould bring extra clothes - the weather usually requires winter coats/hats/
 gloves when the sun goes down. <br><br>4:00-4:15 report<br>4:30pm - move to
  the stands<br>4:35pm- begin to play for the crowd<br>5pm game start and we
  will eat PIZZA while we watch the game<br>We will play to the end of halft
 ime which will be about 6pm ish which is my best guess. <br><br><b>1) They 
 can get picked up and may leave through DOOR #6 ONLY (please do not pick th
 em up at any other door as this is a security issue)</b><br><b>2) They can 
 go back to the game and become part of the student section. </b><br><br>Ple
 ase bring a cell phone to call for a ride or the weather means we cancel. B
 ring $ for concessions if you wish.
