  before the performance.  It is imperative that ALL members be there.  Stud
 ents may NOT miss this rehearsal.\n\nPlease use the back band stairs to ent
 er/exit the building.\n\n6:30 - 8pm\nin marching band uniform\non the footb
 all field.\nPlease bring a bottle of water\, attire\, flip folder\, music\,
  instrument\, etc.\n\nBand Room Opens at 6:15\nReport 6:30\nBe on the field
  by 6:45.\nPractice starts promptly at 6:45\n\nPlease remember to wear blac
 k dress pants\, black shoes and black socks. Sweat pants\, running pants\, 
 or jeans are not acceptable.  They must be dress pants.  You will also need
  your band polo and band jacket. \n\nWe will do a run through at 7:30 to 7:
 45-ish.  Parents are encouraged to attend and watch. 
