DESCRIPTION:Symphonic Band will be performing at 3 schools (see below). Bri
 ng $$ for lunch. You are encouraged to bring a mid-morning snack. We will s
 top at a food court or fast food area with a few different food choices (se
 e below). Please arrange to be picked up a little before 2:30ish.  This is 
 a HALF DAY of class so there will be no PM buses when we return. \n\nSchedu
 le:\nLoad 7:30am\nDepart 7:45am (traffic?)\nArrive at St. Charles 8:15 - 8:
 30ish\nSt. Charles Performance 8:45am\nDepart St. Charles 9:35am\nHighland 
 Catholic Performance 10:15am\nDepart for lunch 11am\nLunch 11:30-12:15pm \n
            We are stopping at a strip mall area about 2 blocks from Highlan
 d Catholic.\n           There is a Jimmy Johns\, Starbucks\, Smashburger\, 
 and a Which Wich\n           Sandwich Shop. \nSt. Rose Performance 1pm\nRet
