 e come to school in concert black. \n\n11:15 -11:45 lunch in the HM cafeter
 ia\n11:45 travel to Tartan High School\n12:00 arrive and unload\n12:15 warm
 -up in band room or choir room\n12:45 performance at Tartan High School (Au
 ditorium) \n1:15 listen to Mahtomedi’s performance while we wait for our sc
 ores\n1:45 load bus and head back to Hill-Murray\n2:00 unload at Hill-Murra
 y\n2:10 dismissal\n\nStudents need to bring their own music\, instrument\, 
 reeds\, tuners\, valve oil\, etc.  Students need to bring their own lunch o
 r bring money to purchase lunch in the HM cafeteria.  Students are represen
 tatives of Hill-Murray School and appropriate behavior is expected. \n\nPar
 ents are welcomed and encouraged to attend the contest performance at Tarta
 n HS.  We would love to see you there to support the HM Band.  If you are u
 nable to attend\, we will be performing the music at the March 15 concert. 
 Please see the Google Calendar for details.  \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221207T002838Z
LOCATION:Tartan High School
