 ts excused from class to load instruments and percussion equipment\, etc. 2
 :15pm\nDepart from HM 2:30pm\nArrive at Mall and unload 3:00pm\nSet-up and 
 warm-up 3:30pm\nPerform 4:00-5:00pm\nBus leaves MOA at 8:30pm.\nReturn to H
 M about 9:00pm. \n\nA packet of information will be sent home with students
  the first week of November.  Please read the packet and return the permiss
 ion slip\, mall waiver\, ride pass/bus pass check list. Thanks! 
