UID:4gpbm10mlc47fcjr97vt5ncvqv@google.com
CREATED:20231023T150911Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr"><b><u>Schedule for Wednesday\, December 6</u></b><
 b>th</b><b> </b></p><p dir="ltr"><b>8:00am</b>: Arrive at H-M wearing Hill-
 Murray Spirit Wear and any type of pants or jeans of any color but NOT Legg
 ings or Sweat Pants. If you have a backpack please store it in your locker.
 </p><p dir="ltr"><b>8:30 </b>Load busses and leave for the Mall of America.
 </p><p dir="ltr"><b>9:00 </b>Drop off at Charter Bus/Group Drop Off Enter M
 all &amp\; walk to the Main Rotunda</p><p dir="ltr"><b>9:30 - 10:00: </b>Se
 t up stage and instruments</p><p dir="ltr"><b>10:00 - 11:00: </b>Bands\, ch
 oirs and orchestras perform</p><p dir="ltr"><b>11:00-11:30: </b>Remove equi
 pment from stage and put away instruments. <b>ALL</b> must help with this</
 p><p dir="ltr"><b>11:30-1:00: </b>Enjoy lunch\, shopping and rides at MOA</
 p><p dir="ltr"><b>1:00: </b>Return to rotunda\, grab instruments\, head to 
 bus and return to HM</p><p dir="ltr"><b>1:30 </b>Bus leaves MOA. </p><p dir
 ="ltr"><b>NOTES ABOUT THE MALL – </b></p><p dir="ltr">1) The Lake Minnetonk
 a Room is right next to the MOA offices which means they will hear  EVERYTH
 ING. You will need to be quiet in that area. Again – ABSOLUTELY NO PLAYING/
 SINGING  DOWNSTAIRS </p><br><p dir="ltr">2) DO NOT bring backpacks or schoo
 l bags around with you. Leave them at School. You may bring a  purse/ small
  drawstring bag or wallet with you.  </p><br><p dir="ltr">3) You are repres
 enting H-M and must be polite and respectful at all times.  </p><br><p dir=
 "ltr">4) Do not freak out – wait patiently for instructions and follow the 
 guidelines we have discussed in class and outlined in this packet. Our whol
 e music family is there and we will all help each other.  </p><br><p dir="l
 tr">5) YOU MUST STAY IN YOUR GROUP AT ALL TIMES. NO EXCEPTIONS. NO CHANGES.
  STAY IN YOUR  GROUP. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231120T141105Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:MOA -HM Music Department at MOA
